    h2How: 'How it works',
    pHow: 'The app is free to download, and every game is free during your 2-week trial — no account or credit card needed to start playing. After the trial, keep any 3 games of your choice free forever for CPU play, or go Premium to unlock everything: online multiplayer, private tables with friends and family, and all future games and features as they arrive.',
    pLang: 'The app is currently in English, with more languages coming soon.',
    h2Touch: 'Get in touch',
